{"id": "hsh-oversight-declined", "title": "City declined to put homelessness contract renewals back before its watchdog", "seconds": 139.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "95da7c0fcb835d90", "words": 448, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[9]"], "text": "San Francisco’s homelessness department pays nonprofits to run shelters and housing.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.59, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Homelessness and Supportive Housing", "sub": "pays nonprofits to run shelters and housing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.7, 1.13, 1.52, 1.76, 2.31, 2.42, 2.61, 2.96, 3.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[9]"], "text": "How much in fiscal 2025?", "t0": 3.71, "t1": 5.54, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Homelessness and Supportive Housing", "sub": "pays nonprofits to run shelters and housing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.36, 0.46, 0.75, 0.99]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[9]", "amount"], "text": "487 million dollars.", "t0": 5.54, "t1": 7.15, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$487 million", "label": "to nonprofits, fiscal 2025", "sub": "about 30 percent of City nonprofit spending"}, "emph": ["487"], "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.48, 0.98, 1.25]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[11]"], "text": "In 2022, voters created its watchdog: the Homelessness Oversight Commission.", "t0": 7.67, "t1": 12.13, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Homelessness Oversight Commission", "sub": "created by voters, Proposition C, 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.43, 1.25, 1.59, 1.98, 2.12, 2.98, 3.1, 3.6, 4.03]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[0]"], "text": "In June 2026, a civil grand jury reported on it.", "t0": 12.25, "t1": 14.94, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Civil grand jury", "sub": "At Scale, At Risk, June 23, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.36, 0.59, 1.25, 1.37, 1.62, 1.85, 2.1, 2.47, 2.59]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "established[0]"], "text": "These are official findings.", "t0": 15.06, "t1": 16.17, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Civil grand jury", "sub": "At Scale, At Risk, June 23, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.3, 0.65]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "First: renewals used to go before the commission.", "t0": 16.39, "t1": 18.63, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-05-01", "to": "2026-06-23", "days": "", "fromLab": "review ended", "toLab": "grand jury report", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.7, 1.09, 1.24, 1.33, 1.5, 1.74, 1.83]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "On May 1, 2025, that stopped.", "t0": 18.75, "t1": 21.02, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2025-05-01", "to": "2026-06-23", "days": "", "fromLab": "review ended", "toLab": "grand jury report", "kicker": "The first finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.38, 0.65, 0.9, 1.72, 1.95]}, {"scene": "find1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[1]"], "text": "Why? The director cited administrative burden.", "t0": 21.14, "t1": 23.65, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "citing administrative burden"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.8, 0.94, 1.34, 1.66, 2.19]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "Second: in August 2025, the commission approved an extension for Urban Alchemy at 711 Post Street.", "t0": 23.87, "t1": 29.31, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Urban Alchemy, 711 Post Street", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "August 7, 2025, six months"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.76, 0.91, 1.14, 1.36, 2.16, 2.27, 2.6, 2.96, 3.06, 3.49, 3.65, 3.94, 4.3, 4.41, 4.68, 4.98, 5.19]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "How much?", "t0": 29.43, "t1": 30.1, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Urban Alchemy, 711 Post Street", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "August 7, 2025, six months"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "4 million dollars.", "t0": 30.1, "t1": 30.93, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$4 million", "label": "a six-month extension", "sub": "approved without discussion"}, "emph": ["4"], "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.51]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "established[2]"], "text": "The staff report mentioned no staffing, safety or community concerns.", "t0": 31.45, "t1": 34.45, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["staffing concerns", "safety concerns", "community concerns"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.34, 0.65, 0.94, 1.09, 1.63, 2.03, 2.14, 2.49]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[12]"], "text": "Yet the Controller had listed this nonprofit as one that must fix problems.", "t0": 34.57, "t1": 37.62, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Tier 2 corrective-action list", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "the Controller, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.24, 0.67, 0.78, 1.04, 1.21, 1.73, 1.86, 2.09, 2.2, 2.38, 2.59]}, {"scene": "find2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].why", "established[12]"], "text": "It disputes the overspending figure.", "t0": 37.74, "t1": 39.23, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Tier 2 corrective-action list", "kicker": "The second finding", "sub": "the Controller, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.55, 0.68, 1.19]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[10]", "established[5]", "suspicious[3]"], "text": "Third: the department doesn’t use incident reports to spot dangerous patterns.", "t0": 39.45, "t1": 43.02, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "No way to compare", "kicker": "The third finding", "sub": "Finding F1: incident reports not used"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.66, 0.8, 1.21, 1.48, 1.72, 2.04, 2.37, 2.49, 2.8, 3.15]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[3]"], "text": "The fix comes later:", "t0": 43.14, "t1": 44.42, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-11-12", "to": "2027-12-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "today", "toLab": "data triggers promised", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.37, 0.6]}, {"scene": "find3", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[3]"], "text": "outlier providers by March 2027, warning signs by December 2027.", "t0": 44.42, "t1": 48.58, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-11-12", "to": "2027-12-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "today", "toLab": "data triggers promised", "kicker": "The third finding"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.44, 0.85, 1.0, 1.21, 1.43, 2.37, 2.67, 2.94, 3.05, 3.42, 3.64]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "Its ask:", "t0": 48.8, "t1": 49.79, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Recommendation R3.1", "kicker": "The ask", "sub": "by December 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[1]", "story[2]"], "text": "renewals back before the commission by December 2026. Who said yes?", "t0": 49.79, "t1": 53.88, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Recommendation R3.1", "kicker": "The ask", "sub": "by December 2026"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.45, 0.64, 0.88, 0.97, 1.36, 1.5, 1.88, 2.12, 3.02, 3.22, 3.45]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "No one.", "t0": 53.88, "t1": 54.34, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["No", "one."], "sub": "Mayor, department and Board all declined"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.27]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "In August 2026, the Mayor and the department turned it down.", "t0": 54.86, "t1": 57.84, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "will not be implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.38, 0.61, 1.4, 1.56, 1.79, 1.87, 1.96, 2.36, 2.58, 2.67]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[3]", "story[3]"], "text": "Because, they said, it adds work, not oversight.", "t0": 57.96, "t1": 60.3, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "will not be implemented"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.5, 0.88, 1.04, 1.26, 1.7, 1.9]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[4]"], "text": "Then the Board of Supervisors passed Resolution 555-26: not warranted.", "t0": 60.42, "t1": 65.05, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "Resolution 555-26"}], "zoomOn": "board", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "September 29, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.26, 0.47, 0.54, 1.15, 1.42, 1.98, 2.23, 2.47, 3.99, 4.2]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "The Board agreed providers can’t be compared, and still said no.", "t0": 65.17, "t1": 68.08, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Board agrees", "no way to compare providers"], "b": ["Board on R3.1", "not warranted"], "kicker": "Commission: R3.1 needs further analysis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.3, 0.57, 0.99, 1.2, 1.31, 1.88, 2.07, 2.36, 2.62]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]"], "text": "The commission wants more study.", "t0": 68.2, "t1": 69.46, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Board agrees", "no way to compare providers"], "b": ["Board on R3.1", "not warranted"], "kicker": "Commission: R3.1 needs further analysis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.46, 0.71, 0.88]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[15]"], "text": "Its public dashboards still report system totals only, nothing by provider.", "t0": 69.58, "t1": 72.95, "shot": "b17d", "visual": {"type": "quote", "kicker": "The department’s dashboards, 21 November 2026", "line": "system totals only: none broken out by provider"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.43, 0.88, 1.1, 1.4, 1.7, 2.01, 2.53, 2.82, 2.95]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "It wasn’t the first ask. In 2022-23, a grand jury wanted outcome measures in these contracts.", "t0": 73.07, "t1": 78.59, "shot": "b17g", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "An earlier ask, 2022-23", "source": "gj1", "text": "asked for consistent outcome measures and monitoring standards in homelessness contracts", "mark": "outcome measures"}, "emph": ["2022-23"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.39, 0.49, 0.76, 1.45, 1.61, 1.89, 2.31, 2.39, 3.12, 3.27, 3.57, 3.85, 4.13, 4.44, 4.72, 4.83, 5.0]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "By 2025, the department still said “in the future.", "t0": 78.71, "t1": 81.59, "shot": "b17g", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "An earlier ask, 2022-23", "source": "gj1", "text": "asked for consistent outcome measures and monitoring standards in homelessness contracts", "mark": "outcome measures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.39, 1.12, 1.24, 1.63, 1.88, 2.15, 2.36, 2.47]}, {"scene": "ask", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[13]"], "text": "The contracting office said no. The Mayor’s office didn’t answer.", "t0": 81.71, "t1": 84.79, "shot": "b17g", "visual": {"type": "doc", "kicker": "An earlier ask, 2022-23", "source": "gj1", "text": "asked for consistent outcome measures and monitoring standards in homelessness contracts", "mark": "outcome measures"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.61, 0.87, 1.11, 1.77, 1.92, 2.22, 2.5, 2.74]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Fourth: a former commissioner never filed her financial-interest forms or finished training.", "t0": 85.01, "t1": 88.98, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Ethics Commission case 26-1031", "kicker": "The fourth finding", "sub": "September 11, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.62, 0.75, 1.03, 1.52, 1.75, 2.02, 2.13, 2.8, 3.17, 3.37, 3.62]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "At how many meetings did she act anyway?", "t0": 89.1, "t1": 91.46, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Ethics Commission case 26-1031", "kicker": "The fourth finding", "sub": "September 11, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.27, 0.47, 0.75, 0.87, 1.04, 1.22]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "established[8]"], "text": "10.", "t0": 91.46, "t1": 91.82, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "10", "label": "meetings while disqualified", "sub": "a $2,300 penalty"}, "emph": ["10"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "established[8]"], "text": "She paid a 2,300 dollar penalty. No financial effect on her interests was found.", "t0": 92.34, "t1": 96.81, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "no financial effect on her interests"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.43, 0.51, 0.71, 1.08, 1.28, 1.51, 1.77, 2.6, 2.8, 3.22, 3.52, 3.61, 3.74, 4.01, 4.15]}, {"scene": "find4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["established[14]", "notEstablished[4]"], "text": "And a member listed for 2026 is an officer of Mercy Housing California,", "t0": 96.93, "t1": 100.93, "shot": "b20m", "visual": {"type": "chain", "kicker": "A name match, confirmed by Form 700", "steps": [{"art": "gavel", "name": "Housing Authority Commission", "sub": "a seat in the 2026 listing"}, {"art": "contract", "name": "Mercy Housing California", "sub": "the member is an officer"}, {"art": "money", "name": "T