pproved an extension of six months.", "t0": 111.91, "t1": 115.72, "shot": "post1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "postboard", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "September 30, 2025", "mark": "September 30, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.57, 1.06, 1.34, 1.91, 2.04, 2.27, 2.62, 2.72, 3.17, 3.26, 3.49]}, {"scene": "post", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[18]"], "text": "HSH reported that Urban Alchemy reached full compliance in November 2025.", "t0": 115.84, "t1": 119.58, "shot": "post2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "postclose", "kicker": "San Francisco Department of Homelessness and Supportive Housing", "text": "November compliance", "mark": "November compliance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.86, 0.98, 1.21, 1.58, 1.78, 1.97, 2.47, 2.56, 2.96, 3.22]}, {"scene": "post", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[18]"], "text": "The Controller’s December list of 14 Tier 2 organizations did not include Urban Alchemy.", "t0": 119.7, "t1": 123.99, "shot": "post3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "postlist", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller", "text": "December Tier 2 list", "mark": "December Tier 2 list"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.58, 0.99, 1.21, 1.3, 1.74, 1.97, 2.14, 2.93, 3.13, 3.29, 3.67, 3.9]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "span", "ref": ["established[7]", "story[4]"], "text": "The Mayor promises to re-bid every contract by May 2029.", "t0": 124.21, "t1": 127.22, "shot": "b21", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2026-08-31", "to": "2029-05-01", "days": "", "fromLab": "plan announced", "toLab": "all contracts re-bid", "kicker": "What comes next"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.72, 0.85, 1.23, 1.44, 1.9, 2.08, 2.25, 2.48]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "No one has found an improper renewal or stolen money,", "t0": 127.34, "t1": 129.69, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Any improper renewal", "Any money stolen", "How many renewals since May 2025"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.3, 0.42, 0.65, 0.74, 1.14, 1.51, 1.61, 1.94]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "or counted the renewals since May 2025.", "t0": 129.69, "t1": 131.84, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Any improper renewal", "Any money stolen", "How many renewals since May 2025"]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.51, 0.62, 0.96, 1.18, 1.35, 1.58]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "What would settle it?", "t0": 131.96, "t1": 132.98, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "A list of every renewal since May 1, 2025"}, {"who": "", "what": "What each approver knew"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.32, 0.6]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "A list of every renewal since May 1, 2025, and what each approver knew.", "t0": 132.98, "t1": 137.13, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "A list of every renewal since May 1, 2025"}, {"who": "", "what": "What each approver knew"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.41, 0.52, 0.77, 1.15, 1.4, 1.62, 1.91, 2.19, 2.96, 3.17, 3.35, 3.52, 3.92]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 137.25, "t1": 139.0, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.53, 0.66, 0.85, 0.92, 1.01, 1.22, 1.45]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "find1": "Finding 1 · review ended", "find2": "Finding 2 · $4 million, no concerns", "find3": "Finding 3 · no data checks", "ask": "The ask · declined three times", "find4": "Finding 4 · 10 meetings", "close": "Where it stands", "post": "The 711 Post extension"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "question"}